              "content": "TAM runs on the shared tokens. XTM still keeps its own copy, and that copy is where most of the debt sits.",
              "lineHeight": 1.14,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 42,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rLWCB",
              "name": "Summary",
              "fill": "$a2-chrome-chip",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "The three workspaces hold 11,349 lines of CSS. XTM's stylesheet carries 439 hex colours and 396 pixel font sizes where TAM carries none of the first. Four of the ten ratchet counters read less than their names promise, so the gates cannot see most of it. This page lists what to improve, where the gaps are, what is broken today, and the order to fix it in.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
