              "content": "Both apps already agree on the focus ring and already avoid transition: all. They disagree on radius, elevation, motion and icon weight, because none of those was ever written down. This is the smallest set of tokens that makes the better-ui and better-accessibility rules computable, built from values the code already uses.",
