              "content": "A design language nobody can measure is a document, not a language. Seven counters, all live in .ratchet-counters now. Each flags a literal value where a token exists, so a var() reference passes and a hand-tuned number does not. The glob covers both apps and every shared stylesheet, five files today, and picks up new ones automatically.",
