              "id": "LZcEx",
              "name": "Caveat",
              "fill": "$a1-ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 960,
              "content": "All seven were proven red before their baselines were recorded: a probe class carrying a literal radius, shadow, duration, outline: none and bare :focus raised six of them, and a transition: all probe raised the seventh from 0 to 1. The first draft of the glob named primitives.css directly and silently missed tour.css, which is the exact mistake this audit opened with, so the probe was re-run inside the newly covered file.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$a1-font",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
